From 9dd6d300dd435fb2b6bebb7ad0316404e0202add Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: stepney141 <stepney141andi.c.i@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 27 Nov 2026 17:02:20 +0900
Subject: [PATCH] perf(movegen): skip excluded lion captures while generating
 qsearch candidates

- Add MoveGenerator::generate_qsearch_special_captures, which restricts the lion's
  second step to enemy squares and the origin instead of filtering after generation
  (movegen-speedup-3 stage 4).
- The public generate_special_captures and is_legal_capture keep their contracts.
