+/// 居喰い、2枚取り、1升で止まる捕獲、直接の跳びと角鷹・飛鷲の経由升だけの捕獲は残す。
+#[test]
+fn qsearch_special_captures_keep_required_special_moves() {
+    use crate::PieceCode;
+    use crate::test_util::{position_from_codes, sq};
+
+    let lion = sq(5, 5);
+    let lion_mid = sq(5, 4);
+    let lion_victim = sq(5, 3);
+    let falcon = sq(2, 8);
+    let falcon_mid = sq(2, 9);
+    let eagle = sq(8, 8);
+    let eagle_mid = sq(9, 9);
+    let pawn = PieceCode::new(Color::White, PieceKind::Pawn).unwrap();
+    let position = position_from_codes(
+        Color::Black,
+        &[
+            (lion, PieceCode::new(Color::Black, PieceKind::Lion).unwrap()),
+            (lion_mid, pawn),
+            (lion_victim, pawn),
+            (
+                falcon,
+                PieceCode::new_promoted(Color::Black, PieceKind::HornedFalcon).unwrap(),
+            ),
+            (falcon_mid, pawn),
+            (
+                eagle,
+                PieceCode::new_promoted(Color::Black, PieceKind::SoaringEagle).unwrap(),
+            ),
+            (eagle_mid, pawn),
+        ],
+    );
+    let generator = MoveGenerator::new(crate::rules::MoveRules::standard());
+    let mut actual = Vec::new();
+    generator.generate_qsearch_special_captures(&position, &mut |c| actual.push(c.mv));
+    for (from, mid, to) in [
+        (lion, Some(lion_mid), lion),
+        (lion, Some(lion_mid), lion_victim),
+        (lion, None, lion_mid),
+        (lion, None, lion_victim),
+        (falcon, Some(falcon_mid), sq(2, 10)),
+        (eagle, Some(eagle_mid), sq(10, 10)),
+    ] {
+        let mv = Move {
+            from,
+            mid,
+            to,
+            promote: false,
+        };
+        assert!(actual.contains(&mv), "missing {mv:?}");
+    }
+    let excluded = Move {
+        from: lion,
+        mid: Some(lion_mid),
+        to: sq(4, 3),
+        promote: false,
+    };
+    let mut public = Vec::new();
+    generator.generate_captures(&position, &mut public);
+    assert!(public.contains(&excluded));
+    assert!(!actual.contains(&excluded), "included {excluded:?}");
+}
+
+/// 先獅子が発動した場合だけ、足のある相手獅子の居喰いを禁じる（第15条第1項・第9項）。
+#[test]
+fn qsearch_special_captures_respect_senjishi() {
+    use crate::test_util::{position, sq};
+
+    let from = sq(5, 5);
+    let mid = sq(5, 4);
+    let previous_capture = sq(8, 5);
+    let mut board = position(
+        Color::Black,
+        &[
+            (from, Color::Black, PieceKind::Lion),
+            (mid, Color::White, PieceKind::Lion),
+            (sq(4, 5), Color::White, PieceKind::CopperGeneral),
+            (previous_capture, Color::White, PieceKind::Rook),
+        ],
+    );
+    let igui = Move {
+        from,
+        mid: Some(mid),
+        to: from,
+        promote: false,
+    };
+    let generator = MoveGenerator::new(crate::rules::MoveRules::standard());
+    for (trigger, expected) in [(None, true), (Some(previous_capture), false)] {
+        board.set_lion_capture(trigger).unwrap();
+        let mut found = false;
+        generator.generate_qsearch_special_captures(&board, &mut |c| found |= c.mv == igui);
+        assert_eq!(found, expected, "trigger={trigger:?}");
+    }
+}
